ommit breaks that deadlock.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(codex-keepalive): apply updates (PR #23)\n\n* chore: drop generated build artifacts from the tree\n\nAdversarial review flagged these as scope: src/doc_lineage.egg-info/ is regenerated\nby setuptools, and committing it let a build artifact change the ruff pin from\n0.16.5 to 0.16.6 with no matching pyproject.toml change -- a dependency bump nobody\nreviewed. agents/codex-6.md is agent execution scratch, not project content.\n\nBoth are now gitignored so they cannot come back.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(codex-keepalive): apply updates (PR #23)\n\n* chore(codex-keepalive): apply updates (PR #23)\n\n* chore(codex-keepalive): apply updates (PR #23)\n\n* chore(codex-keepalive): apply updates (PR #23)\n\n* Validate vocabulary contracts through production resource loading\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: stranske <tim@stranskemo.com>","timestamp":"2026-09-14T11:49:51Z","author":{"name":"stranske","email":"stranske@gmail.com"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com"}},"repository":{"id":1357292717,"node_id":"R_kgDOUOakrQ","name":"Doc-Lineage","full_name":"stranske/Doc-Lineage","private":false,"owner":{"login":"stranske","id":23046322,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDQ2MzIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23046322?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stranske","html_url":"https://github.com/stranske","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stranske/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stranske/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stranske/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stranske